========================================================================
[A] the 8 trigrams = F2^3; Earth = identity; the 7 = Fano points [Т]
  trigrams as 3-bit values: {'Earth': 0, 'Thunder': 1, 'Water': 2, 'Mountain': 4, 'Wind': 6, 'Fire': 5, 'Lake': 3, 'Heaven': 7}
  Earth=000=identity of XOR; nonzero 7 = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7] = Fano points = voices

[B] the King-Wen family IS weight arithmetic [Т]
  sons (weight 1): Mountain, Thunder, Water
  daughters (weight 2): Fire, Lake, Wind
  son XOR son = daughter: all 3 pairs ✓
  son XOR complementary daughter = Heaven (father): ✓

[C] Fuxi (Earlier-Heaven) circle: opposites are complements [Т]
  4 opposite pairs, each XOR = 111 (complements): ✓

[D] hexagram = trigram pair => 64 = F2^6 (consistency) [Т]
  8 x 8 pairs = 64 = F2^6 — the established hexagram layer.

[E] octonions as twisted group algebra over F2^3 [Т]
  Cayley-Dickson unit products land on XOR of indices: yes [T]
  associator witness (e1 e2) e4 != e1 (e2 e4): signs differ -> nonassociative [T]

verdict: trigram composition (line-wise XOR) = the octonion basis'
underlying group F2^3; Earth is the unit, the seven moving trigrams
are the Fano points/voices; the King-Wen family, the Fuxi circle and
the 64 hexagrams agree with the declared encodings [T].
The twist (signs) is exactly what upgrades the group algebra to the
octonions: sigma is a 2-cochain; its cocycle defect is nonassociativity.
Non-symmetry instead detects noncommutativity; these are different laws.
Line order, yin=0 and the added XOR operation are explicit choices.
The integer encoding uses the bottom line as the least significant bit;
top-line-first integer encodings require bit reversal, not identity.
